Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:04.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Did you express everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:04.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}that you wanted to express?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:04.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}言いたいことは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:04.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}全部言えた？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Did we get that, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ちゃんと聞けたかな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:10.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because I got to go in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:10.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I got to go. I got to leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:10.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あと20分で　出なきゃいけないんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:10.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}もうすぐ行かないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I ain't going to lie to you, Kanye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I'm going to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ウソはつかないよ、Kanye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}正直に言う
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You didn't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}あんたはここに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}来なくてもよかった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You could have went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to Stephen A. Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Stephen A. Smithのとこに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}行ってもよかった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You could have went to Oprah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}You could have went to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Oprahでもいいし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}誰のとこでもよかった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But you know what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でもあんたは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You came back to the culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}カルチャーに戻ってきてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Boy, they did. Don't clap yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}まだ拍手するな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We could have been scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and guess what? We were scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ビビってもおかしくなかったし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}実際ビビってた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But you're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でもあんたは兄弟だから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I like that I have that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}effect on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}人をそういう気持ちにさせるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}悪くないね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:49.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I like that I have that... You don't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:49.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}want to let me finish my speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:49.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「悪くないね」って…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:49.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺に最後まで言わせない気？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:50.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Go ahead, go ahead, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:50.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}どうぞどうぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Wait, wait. Do you not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}think you have the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}待って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺たちがあんたのやることを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}effect that we really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}love what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}本気で愛してるって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかってる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I like that. I like the love,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and I like the fear also.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それもいい　愛されるのもいいし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}恐れられるのもいい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.45,0:01:04.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Nah, but on the cultural standpoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.45,0:01:04.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いや、カルチャー的にさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}we love what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}You mean so much to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちはあんたを愛してる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}すごく大事な存在なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Good Morning America?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Nah, they don't give a f**k.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Good Morning America？　あいつらは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}何とも思ってない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And by the way, because that's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the thing, Tucker Carlson,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それにTucker Carlsonだって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:15.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}they're going to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:15.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}up to the point where I'm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:15.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺がトランプを支持してる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:15.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ところまでしか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:17.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}like, supporting Trump, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:17.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}助けてくれない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's all they care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}あいつらが気にするのは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それだけだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:22.46,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Stephen A. Smith：ESPNの名物コメンテーター
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:27.08,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Oprah：Oprah Winfrey。アメリカを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:27.08,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}代表するトーク番組司会者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:11.83,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Good Morning America：ABCの朝の情報番組
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:17.78,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Tucker Carlson：Fox Newsの司会者。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:17.78,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}2022年10月にYeをインタビューした
